<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-3" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic once Tier 15 Celestial Dungeons become available, as well as the new Alliance and Horde reputations.<br/>
<br/>Note that while <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95818/lei-shens-orb-of-command">
<img alt="Lei Shen's Orb of Command" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_1h_thunderisleraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lei Shen's Orb of Command</span></a> is the off-hand available from Celestial Dungeons with the best stat combination, it is still worthwhile to go for a shield such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95692/tortos-discarded-shell">
<img alt="Tortos' Discarded Shell" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shield_thunderisleraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tortos' Discarded Shell</span></a> in order to reduce physical damage taken in the current phase.<br/>
<br/>
