<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>Galleon is a World Boss that has a chance to reward those who kill him with 496-iLvl loot. As a Restoration Shaman, there are 8 different items we want.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90452/sparkmaker-girdle">
<img alt="Sparkmaker Girdle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sparkmaker Girdle</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90422/armor-of-the-single-cloud">
<img alt="Armor of the Single Cloud" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armor of the Single Cloud</span></a></div></li>
