<img alt="Burnmender Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burnmender Boots</span></a></div></li>
