<img alt="Stomphowl Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stomphowl Pendant</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_jewelry_trinketpvp_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> PvP and BoE World Drops</span></h2>While not necessary, using some PvP gear is helpful for early gearing,  given that you can buy exactly the slots you need for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> before raids are even out. There are also some very powerful Bind-on-Equip Epics, which are sure to be extremely expensive but also good early options for min-maxers, and we give examples of the best of both below.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84888/malevolent-gladiators-pendant-of-meditation">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Pendant of Meditation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pvp_neck_a3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Pendant of Meditation</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84825/malevolent-gladiators-band-of-meditation">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Band of Meditation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pvp_ringc3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Band of Meditation</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84984/malevolent-gladiators-armbands-of-meditation">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Armbands of Meditation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_mail_pvpshaman_e_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Armbands of Meditation</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
