<img alt="Kilt of Pandaren Promises" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_raidshaman_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kilt of Pandaren Promises</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
