<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="crafted-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mace_39.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Crafted &amp; Profession Gear for Restoration Shamans</span></h2>Crafted items are for the most part no longer restricted by profession, meaning that even if you aren't a Leatherworker, you can equip anything Leatherworkers craft. There are a few notable exceptions to this: the Engineer goggles and the Alchemist trinket. There is also the Inscription staff, which is Bound to Account.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94276/cloud-serpent-helm">
<img alt="Cloud Serpent Helm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_mail_raidshaman_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloud Serpent Helm</span></a> is a new <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> piece with strong stats for anyone lacking raid gear in the head slot.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=94275/cloud-serpent-sabatons">
<img alt="Cloud Serpent Sabatons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_mail_raidshaman_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloud Serpent Sabatons</span></a> is another Leatherworking piece which you can use to cover the feet slot, if needed.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79331/relic-of-yulon">
<img alt="Relic of Yu'lon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_dragon.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Yu'lon</span></a> is made through <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=773/inscription">
<img alt="Inscription" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription</span></a> and is one of our best Trinkets early on.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79330/relic-of-chi-ji">
<img alt="Relic of Chi-Ji" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_crane.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Chi-Ji</span></a> is also made with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=773/inscription">
<img alt="Inscription" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription</span></a> and is a cheaper starter option.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79335/inscribed-red-fan">
<img alt="Inscribed Red Fan" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_1h_pandariatradeskill_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Red Fan</span></a> is also made with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=773/inscription">
<img alt="Inscription" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription</span></a> and, while less important than the trinkets, is still a good upgrade early on, while your choices are limited.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85826/lifekeepers-robe">
<img alt="Lifekeeper's Robe" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lifekeeper's Robe</span></a> is made with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>. It sports good stats and two sockets, making it very powerful early on, when it competes against blue gear.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85825/lifekeepers-gloves">
<img alt="Lifekeeper's Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lifekeeper's Gloves</span></a> is also made with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> and is another great option early on.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85840/stormbreaker-chestguard">
<img alt="Stormbreaker Chestguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stormbreaker Chestguard</span></a> is also made with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>. As it has Crit on it and competes for the same spot as tier pieces, it is not recommended to go for this once we have access to tier pieces from Celestial dungeons.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85821/fists-of-lightning">
<img alt="Fists of Lightning" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fists of Lightning</span></a> is also made with <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a>. It has a good distribution of secondary stats, but it does compete against tier pieces, which makes it hard to slot into our gear set once Celestial dungeons are available.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=77537/energized-retinal-armor">
<img alt="Energized Retinal Armor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_goggles_pandariatradeskill_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Energized Retinal Armor</span></a> is exclusive to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=202/engineering">
<img alt="Engineering" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Engineering</span></a>. You can choose your two preferred secondary stats for this item, making it always a strong pick before tier sets are available.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=75274/zen-alchemist-stone">
<img alt="Zen Alchemist Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_scorchedstone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zen Alchemist Stone</span></a> is exclusive to Alchemists and is very strong despite its low item level. You can use it until you have access to Celestial, raid, or Inscription trinkets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79340/inscribed-crane-staff">
<img alt="Inscribed Crane Staff" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_2h_pandariatradeskill_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscribed Crane Staff</span></a> is made through <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/skill=773/inscription">
<img alt="Inscription" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_tradeskill01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription</span></a>, and is Bound to Account. This means you can craft it on an alt and send it to your main, although you can not buy it from other players. This also gives you the opportunity to send it between multiple characters with just one craft.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Pre-Raid Restoration Shaman Trinkets</span></h2>You mostly want as many stats as possible from healing trinkets, especially Intellect and Spirit, which are plentiful in many. Generally speaking, pick the highest listed item for the best effect, and make sure to use active trinkets along with your cooldowns for maximum effect.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>Passive trinkets are generally superior for Restoration because they offer more stats for the same item level, but <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=93254/static-casters-medallion">
<img alt="Static-Caster's Medallion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_vehicle_electrocharge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Static-Caster's Medallion</span></a> is also a decent option. Both <b>Brewfest</b> trinkets are very good for how easy they are to get and <b>heavily recommended for new characters</b>.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Passive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95641/horridons-last-gasp">
<img alt="Horridon's Last Gasp" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_eyeofthestorm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Horridon's Last Gasp</span></a> is a simple stat stick that grants you extra Mana passively, making it a strong trinket in all situations.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95817/lightning-imbued-chalice">
<img alt="Lightning-Imbued Chalice" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_mage_runeofpower.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lightning-Imbued Chalice</span></a> provides a good throughput increase with its passive Intellect, and has an interesting effect that will cause additional healing passively as you accumulate Infinite Power charges from your regular healing.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79331/relic-of-yulon">
<img alt="Relic of Yu'lon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_dragon.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Yu'lon</span></a> is a very powerful trinket. With a lot of Intellect and a strong Intellect proc with high uptime, this trinket is far stronger than its item level would suggest.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79330/relic-of-chi-ji">
<img alt="Relic of Chi-Ji" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_crane.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Chi-Ji</span></a> is also good and much cheaper than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79331/relic-of-yulon">
<img alt="Relic of Yu'lon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_dragon.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Yu'lon</span></a>.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86907/essence-of-terror">
<img alt="Essence of Terror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pvp_trinket.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Essence of Terror</span></a> provides a lot of Intellect and burst Haste, which can be strong for Mana regeneration with <a class="q1 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=41536/glyph-of-telluric-currents">
<img alt="Glyph of Telluric Currents" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glyph_majorshaman.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glyph of Telluric Currents</span></a> or for extra healing if it procs at the right time.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86805/qin-xis-polarizing-seal">
<img alt="Qin-xi's Polarizing Seal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trinketpanda_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qin-xi's Polarizing Seal</span></a> is similar to the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81133/empty-fruit-barrel">
<img alt="Empty Fruit Barrel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cask_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Empty Fruit Barrel</span></a> with slightly increased item level.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=75274/zen-alchemist-stone">
<img alt="Zen Alchemist Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_scorchedstone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zen Alchemist Stone</span></a> has a very strong proc, allowing it to compete as one of our best pre-raid trinkets.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81133/empty-fruit-barrel">
<img alt="Empty Fruit Barrel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cask_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Empty Fruit Barrel</span></a> this is a strong early trinket and also relatively easy to obtain.</div></li></ul>
<ins>Active Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=93254/static-casters-medallion">
<img alt="Static-Caster's Medallion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_vehicle_electrocharge.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Static-Caster's Medallion</span></a> is the best on-use trinket, but still overall behind most passive options.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=93255/cutstitcher-medallion">
<img alt="Cutstitcher Medallion" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_spellcloththread.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cutstitcher Medallion</span></a>'s Spirit on use is decent for Restoration, but the overall amount of stats on the trinket is not great.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89080/scroll-of-revered-ancestors">
<img alt="Scroll of Revered Ancestors" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_highborne_scroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scroll of Revered Ancestors</span></a> provides Spirit on use for a little bit of added Regen, which unfortunately does not multiply with <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=16190/mana-tide-totem">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_frost_summonwaterelemental.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mana Tide Totem</span></a>, making it a decent but not great option.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89081/blossom-of-pure-snow">
<img alt="Blossom of Pure Snow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_herbd.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blossom of Pure Snow</span></a> is a decent trinket for Restoration, as you can line up its on-use effect with your cooldowns while also spreading them to hit various incoming damage events every minute.</div></li></ul>
<ins>Brewfest Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=257881/thousand-year-pickled-egg">
<img alt="Thousand-Year Pickled Egg" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_egg_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Thousand-Year Pickled Egg</span></a> procs from healing, and is fairly good for Restoration, being one of the best non-BiS trinkets for this phase.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=257884/mithril-wristwatch">
<img alt="Mithril Wristwatch" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pocketwatch_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mithril Wristwatch</span></a> has passive Critical Strike, which is a good stat for Restoration, and your frequent damage spells will be able to activate it, making it a decent trinket if you are actively DPSing for Mana with <a class="q1 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=41536/glyph-of-telluric-currents">
<img alt="Glyph of Telluric Currents" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glyph_majorshaman.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glyph of Telluric Currents</span></a>.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="hit-expertise">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_marksmanship.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reaching Hit and Expertise Cap for Restoration Shamans</span></h2>In Mists of Pandaria the Spell Hit cap is 15% but Restoration Shamans do not have to worry about it because the <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=112858/spiritual-insight">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_elementalabsorption.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spiritual Insight</span></a> passive takes care of all Spell Hit needs by default.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="gemming">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_uncut_purple.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Gems for Restoration Shamans</span></h3>Gems are a great place to stack more of your favorite stats, which for Restoration tends to be Intellect, Haste and Spirit, since it is the only useful throughput stat that can appear on Blue Sockets.<br/>
<br/>You will generally want to take all socket bonuses as in Mists of Pandaria you get double the secondary stats for every point of Intellect on gems, making it worthwhile to not always go for pure Intellect.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="q9">Meta Gem</span>: <a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95345/courageous-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Courageous Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendary_chimeraoffear.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Courageous Primal Diamond</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76885/burning-primal-diamond">
<img alt="Burning Primal Diamond" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_metagem_cut.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burning Primal Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c6">Red Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76694/brilliant-primordial-ruby">
<img alt="Brilliant Primordial Ruby" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_red.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Brilliant Primordial Ruby</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="c11">Orange Gem</span>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=76668/reckless-vermilion-onyx">
<img alt="Reckless Vermilion Onyx" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_x4_rare_cut_orange.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Vermilion Onyx</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
